          { stage: "Stage 3 (Hybrid Turbo)", power: "340 - 360 hp", notes: "Requires a hybrid turbocharger, upgraded high-pressure fuel pump, and custom tuning. Pushing past 330hp on the N26 block is highly risky for the factory connecting rods; proceeding beyond this point requires forged engine internals to ensure longevity.", zeroToHundred: "4.9s", hundredToTwoHundred: "11.7s" }
